{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-load-balancing","title":"路由与负载均衡：网关如何将请求精准分发到后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/routing-load-balancing","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由与负载均衡-网关如何将请求精准分发到后端\">路由与负载均衡：网关如何将请求精准分发到后端</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>路由规则（Route）</strong></td>\n<td>定义&quot;哪类请求&quot;发到&quot;哪个上游&quot;的匹配规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>上游（Upstream）</strong></td>\n<td>网关背后的一组后端服务实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>负载均衡算法</strong></td>\n<td>在多个上游实例间分发请求的策略（轮询、加权、最少连接等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>灰度发布路由</strong></td>\n<td>按比例或按 Header 将流量分流到新旧版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>虚拟主机（Virtual Host）</strong></td>\n<td>基于 Host Header 将不同域名路由到不同上游</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路由匹配机制\">路由匹配机制</h2><p>路由规则由<strong>匹配条件</strong>和<strong>目标上游</strong>两部分组成。当请求到达网关时，路由引擎从已配置的规则列表中找到第一条匹配的规则，将请求转发给对应上游。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匹配维度\">匹配维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>路径前缀</strong></td>\n<td><code>/api/users</code></td>\n<td>最常用，按 URL 前缀分流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>精确路径</strong></td>\n<td><code>/health</code></td>\n<td>仅匹配精确 URL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>正则路径</strong></td>\n<td><code>^/api/v[0-9]+/</code></td>\n<td>灵活但性能较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Host</strong></td>\n<td><code>api.example.com</code></td>\n<td>多租户或多产品共用同一网关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>HTTP Method</strong></td>\n<td><code>GET /read-only</code></td>\n<td>区分读写路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Header 值</strong></td>\n<td><code>X-Version: v2</code></td>\n<td>灰度/AB 测试路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Query 参数</strong></td>\n<td><code>?region=cn</code></td>\n<td>地域路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"路由优先级\">路由优先级</h3><p>多个规则可能同时匹配同一请求，优先级规则通常为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"精确匹配 &gt; 前缀匹配（最长前缀优先）&gt; 正则匹配 &gt; 默认规则\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>精确匹配 > 前缀匹配（最长前缀优先）> 正则匹配 > 默认规则</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以 Kong 配置为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 路由 1：精确匹配（优先）&#10;- name: user-detail&#10;  paths: [&#39;/api/v1/users/me&#39;]&#10;  methods: [&#39;GET&#39;]&#10;  service: user-service&#10;&#10;# 路由 2：前缀匹配（次优先）&#10;- name: user-api&#10;  paths: [&#39;/api/v1/users&#39;]&#10;  service: user-service&#10;&#10;# 路由 3：通配兜底&#10;- name: fallback&#10;  paths: [&#39;/&#39;]&#10;  service: 404-handler\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 路由 1：精确匹配（优先）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user-detail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users/me'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  methods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 路由 2：前缀匹配（次优先）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 路由 3：通配兜底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fallback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">404-handler</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"负载均衡算法\">负载均衡算法</h2><p>当上游有多个实例时，网关使用负载均衡算法决定将请求发往哪个实例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轮询-round-robin\">轮询（Round Robin）</h3><p>最简单的策略，请求依次分配给每个实例，实例权重相同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"实例列表: [A, B, C]&#10;请求序列: 1→A, 2→B, 3→C, 4→A, 5→B, 6→C, ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>实例列表: [A, B, C]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>请求序列: 1→A, 2→B, 3→C, 4→A, 5→B, 6→C, ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适用场景：所有实例性能相同，无状态服务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"加权轮询-weighted-round-robin\">加权轮询（Weighted Round Robin）</h3><p>为不同实例设置权重，性能强的实例接收更多请求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"upstream:&#10;  targets:&#10;    - target: svc-v1:8080&#10;      weight: 70 # 旧版本承担 70% 流量&#10;    - target: svc-v2:8080&#10;      weight: 30 # 新版本承担 30% 流量（灰度）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">upstream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">svc-v1:8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 旧版本承担 70% 流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">svc-v2:8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 新版本承担 30% 流量（灰度）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"最少连接-least-connections\">最少连接（Least Connections）</h3><p>将请求发给当前活跃连接数最少的实例，适合请求处理时间差异大的场景（如混合快慢请求）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一致性哈希-consistent-hashing\">一致性哈希（Consistent Hashing）</h3><p>根据请求的某个特征（如 User-ID、Cookie、IP）做哈希，同一特征的请求始终路由到同一实例。</p>\n<p>适用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要服务端会话粘性（但推荐用无状态 JWT 替代）</li>\n<li>缓存命中率优化（同一 key 总路由到同一实例，实例内存缓存更有效）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"# NGINX 一致性哈希配置&#10;upstream backend {&#10;    hash $http_x_user_id consistent;&#10;    server svc-1:8080;&#10;    server svc-2:8080;&#10;    server svc-3:8080;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># NGINX 一致性哈希配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>upstream backend {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hash $http_x_user_id consistent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server svc-1:8080;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server svc-2:8080;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    server svc-3:8080;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"健康检查与摘除\">健康检查与摘除</h2><p>负载均衡需要配合健康检查，自动摘除不健康实例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"被动健康检查-passive\">被动健康检查（Passive）</h3><p>网关观察真实请求的响应码，连续多次 5xx 后标记实例为不健康：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kong 健康检查配置示例&#10;healthchecks:&#10;  passive:&#10;    unhealthy:&#10;      http_failures: 5 # 连续 5 次 HTTP 错误触发摘除&#10;      http_statuses: [500, 502, 503, 504]&#10;    healthy:&#10;      successes: 2 # 连续 2 次成功后恢复\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kong 健康检查配置示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">healthchecks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  passive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    unhealthy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http_failures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 5 次 HTTP 错误触发摘除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http_statuses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">502</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">503</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">504</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      successes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 2 次成功后恢复</span></span></code></pre></div><p>被动检查的问题：需要真实用户请求触发，实例刚变坏时会有少量请求命中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主动健康检查-active\">主动健康检查（Active）</h3><p>网关定期主动发送探测请求（类似 k8s Probe）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"active:&#10;  http_path: &#39;/healthz&#39;&#10;  interval: 10 # 每 10 秒探测一次&#10;  timeout: 2&#10;  healthy:&#10;    interval: 5&#10;    successes: 1&#10;  unhealthy:&#10;    http_failures: 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">active</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/healthz'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每 10 秒探测一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  healthy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    successes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  unhealthy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    http_failures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主动检查能在真实流量到达前就发现问题，是生产推荐配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灰度发布路由\">灰度发布路由</h2><p>灰度发布（Canary Release）是将一小部分流量导入新版本验证效果的发布策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于权重的灰度\">基于权重的灰度</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    GW[API Gateway] --&gt;|70%| V1[svc-v1\\n稳定版]&#10;    GW --&gt;|30%| V2[svc-v2\\n金丝雀版]\">graph LR\n    GW[API Gateway] --&gt;|70%| V1[svc-v1\\n稳定版]\n    GW --&gt;|30%| V2[svc-v2\\n金丝雀版]</pre><p>在网关配置两个上游，用加权轮询分流。新版本无问题后逐步调整权重（30%→50%→100%）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于-header-的灰度\">基于 Header 的灰度</h3><p>内测用户或特定客户端携带特殊 Header，网关将其路由到新版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# APISIX traffic-split 插件配置&#10;match:&#10;  - vars:&#10;      - [&#39;http_x-canary-user&#39;, &#39;==&#39;, &#39;true&#39;]&#10;weighted_upstreams:&#10;  - upstream_id: svc-v2 # 匹配的用户全部走 v2&#10;    weight: 100\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># APISIX traffic-split 插件配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">vars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http_x-canary-user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'=='</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">weighted_upstreams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">upstream_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">svc-v2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 匹配的用户全部走 v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式让 QA 团队可以在生产环境测试新版本，不影响普通用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由配置的常见陷阱\">路由配置的常见陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>路由顺序依赖</strong></td>\n<td>规则顺序不对导致请求匹配到错误路由</td>\n<td>用精确度排序代替手动顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>缓存陈旧路由</strong></td>\n<td>动态更新配置时旧路由仍在处理请求</td>\n<td>使用支持热更新的网关（APISIX/Envoy）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>遗忘兜底规则</strong></td>\n<td>未匹配的请求返回 502 而非友好错误</td>\n<td>总是配置一个兜底路由返回 404/503</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>一致性哈希倾斜</strong></td>\n<td>哈希 key 分布不均导致单实例过载</td>\n<td>监控实例 RPS，必要时换轮询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关路由是&quot;请求入场后的第一关&quot;。路由规则按优先级（精确 &gt; 最长前缀 &gt; 正则）匹配，负载均衡在匹配的上游实例间分发——轮询/加权轮询适合无状态服务，一致性哈希适合需要亲和性的场景。健康检查（主动 + 被动）确保流量只发往健康实例。灰度路由（权重分流 + Header 分流）是安全发布新版本的标配。网关的协议处理能力见下一篇<a href=\"protocol-transformation\">协议转换与请求变换</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由与负载均衡：网关如何将请求精准分发到后端","id":"路由与负载均衡-网关如何将请求精准分发到后端"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路由匹配机制","id":"路由匹配机制"},{"level":3,"text":"匹配维度","id":"匹配维度"},{"level":3,"text":"路由优先级","id":"路由优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"负载均衡算法","id":"负载均衡算法"},{"level":3,"text":"轮询（Round Robin）","id":"轮询-round-robin"},{"level":3,"text":"加权轮询（Weighted Round Robin）","id":"加权轮询-weighted-round-robin"},{"level":3,"text":"最少连接（Least Connections）","id":"最少连接-least-connections"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性哈希（Consistent Hashing）","id":"一致性哈希-consistent-hashing"},{"level":2,"text":"健康检查与摘除","id":"健康检查与摘除"},{"level":3,"text":"被动健康检查（Passive）","id":"被动健康检查-passive"},{"level":3,"text":"主动健康检查（Active）","id":"主动健康检查-active"},{"level":2,"text":"灰度发布路由","id":"灰度发布路由"},{"level":3,"text":"基于权重的灰度","id":"基于权重的灰度"},{"level":3,"text":"基于 Header 的灰度","id":"基于-header-的灰度"},{"level":2,"text":"路由配置的常见陷阱","id":"路由配置的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网关架构总览：API 网关在微服务中的位置与职责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/gateway-architecture-overview"},"next":{"title":"协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/protocol-transformation"}}